dsh-cmdwatch README · 零预估等待任务完成（key 形如 job:pwsh-3 或 tool:call_xxx）：$r = Invoke-RestMethod 'http://127.0.0.1:<端口>/cmdmon/wait?key=job:pwsh-3&timeout_ms=600000'
if (-not $r.timedOut) { "任务结束：$($r.record.status)（$($r.record.detail)）" }
```

dsh-cmdwatch README · Zero-estimate wait (key looks like job:pwsh-3 or tool:call_xxx)：$r = Invoke-RestMethod 'http://127.0.0.1:<port>/cmdmon/wait?key=job:pwsh-3&timeout_ms=600000'
if (-not $r.timedOut) { "done: $($r.record.status) ($($r.record.detail))" }
